  "worked_answers": {
    "B1_B2": "Ready still checks pending text/reservation; empty text is not nil. Release neither deletes pending content nor starts capture; claim itself does not check pending.",
    "B3_B4": "Enabled needsModel is a model action, not capture readiness; non-cancellable delivery is not idle.",
    "B5_B7": "A free lower pipeline reaches only the permission boundary, not admission through a busy controller; a retained pipeline is busy.",
    "B6": "Preparing needs both permission and foreground. Start/recording/prewarm/preview here are memory effects, not device outcomes.",
    "B8": "Neither suppression result makes the controller ready or releases admission; the outer recovery method is not executed. The recording-phase button means stop in source."
  },
  "fixture_boundary": "Presets/readiness are manual assumptions, not UI actions, permission, background/model or full start. The lower probe uses only two original guards; debounce consumes synthetic Date/UUID/bools, not OS events.",
